{
  "_comment": [
    "TEMPLATE for a lab's machine profiles, used by mousereach-setup and the Setup panel.",
    "This file itself is never matched against a machine: copy it, edit it for your lab,",
    "and put the copy where setup looks for it, first match wins:",
    "  1. the path in the MOUSEREACH_LAB_PROFILES environment variable",
    "     (one shared copy, e.g. on the lab's network share, that every machine points at)",
    "  2. ~/.mousereach/lab_profiles.json on the machine",
    "  3. lab_profiles.json beside this file (git-ignored, so a pull or re-clone never brings it)",
    "",
    "A machine takes the profile named in ~/.mousereach/machine_role.json",
    "(mousereach-setup --set-role \"<profile name>\"), otherwise the first profile whose",
    "match rules all hold. A profile only FILLS IN what the machine does not have:",
    "settings already in ~/.mousereach/config.json are never replaced.",
    "",
    "Match rules (every rule given must hold):",
    "  hostname:        the machine's name, or a list of names (most reliable)",
    "  drives_present:  drive letters that must exist",
    "  drives_local:    drives that must exist and be local (not network)",
    "  drives_absent:   drives that must NOT exist on this machine",
    "",
    "defaults: any setting of ~/.mousereach/config.json -- nas_drive, nas_root,",
    "processing_root, the watcher section (including settings setup does not ask",
    "about, such as mode, also_process, pause_while_running, recording_days,",
    "recording_hours, max_local_pending) and other sections such as backup.",
    "Values in <angle brackets> are placeholders to replace."
  ],

  "profiles": [
    {
      "name": "Recording + GPU PC",
      "description": "Records videos and, outside recording, cuts and poses them on its GPU; hands each pose to the shared Posed folder for the processing machine.",
      "match": {
        "hostname": "<this PC's hostname>"
      },
      "defaults": {
        "nas_drive": "<shared drive>:\\",
        "nas_root": "<shared drive>:\\<path>\\MouseReach_Pipeline",
        "processing_root": "<local drive>:\\<path>\\MouseReach_Pipeline",
        "watcher": {
          "mode": "dlc_pc",
          "also_process": false,
          "dlc_config_path": "<local path to the DLC model>\\config.yaml",
          "dlc_gpu_device": 0,
          "pause_while_running": ["<recording program>.exe"],
          "recording_days": "<e.g. Mon-Fri>",
          "recording_hours": "<e.g. 08:00-17:00>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "GPU PC",
      "description": "Cuts and poses videos on its GPU; no recording here, so no pause settings.",
      "match": {
        "hostname": "<this PC's hostname>"
      },
      "defaults": {
        "nas_drive": "<shared drive>:\\",
        "nas_root": "<shared drive>:\\<path>\\MouseReach_Pipeline",
        "processing_root": "<local drive>:\\<path>\\MouseReach_Pipeline",
        "watcher": {
          "mode": "dlc_pc",
          "also_process": false,
          "dlc_config_path": "<local path to the DLC model>\\config.yaml",
          "dlc_gpu_device": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Processing Server",
      "description": "Analyses posed videos taken from the shared Posed folder and files the results; no GPU needed.",
      "match": {
        "hostname": "<the server's hostname>"
      },
      "defaults": {
        "nas_drive": "<shared drive>:\\",
        "nas_root": "<shared drive>:\\<path>\\MouseReach_Pipeline",
        "processing_root": "<local drive>:\\<path>\\MouseReach_Pipeline",
        "watcher": {
          "mode": "processing_server",
          "max_local_pending": 2
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
